# === Environment / secrets lockdown ===
# Blocks these from: semantic search, Agent file reads, Tab, Inline Edit, @ mentions.
# NOTE: this does NOT block terminal commands or MCP tools run by Agent.
# See .cursor/rules/no-env-access.mdc + Terminal command deny-list for that layer.

.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!.env.sample

# Common secret/credential file patterns while we're at it
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa
**/id_rsa.pub
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/secrets.yml
**/secrets.yaml
.npmrc
.pypirc
.netrc
**/*.keystore
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
